  "At {her}'s family dinner, an aunty asks how much you plan to earn. Later, {her}: \"Does my family's opinion matter to you?\"": "在{her}家的饭桌上，一个阿姨问你打算赚多少。之后{her}问：“我家人的意见对你重要吗？”",
